    "section_accordion_group_PQGngM": {
      "type": "section-accordion-group",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_jTmgED": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Frequently Asked Questions",
            "align_text": "text-center",
            "heading_font_family": "secondary-heading__font",
            "heading_font_size": "heading-large"
          }
        },
        "question_TnTm79": {
          "type": "question",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "default_open": false,
            "title": "{{ product.metafields.faq.question_first.value }}",
            "content": "<p>{{ product.metafields.faq.answer_first | metafield_tag }}<\/p>",
            "show_icon": false,
            "icon_name": "icon-award",
            "icon_size": 20,
            "icon_color": ""
          }
        },
        "question_TpgFjQ": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "default_open": true,
            "title": "How to make an instant coffee latte?",
            "content": "<p>Simply add water and treat yourself to a hot or iced latte. <\/p><ul><li>For an iced latte: Add 8oz of water and ice. Shake for 20 seconds & enjoy!<\/li><li>For a hot latte: add 8oz of hot water. Stir for 20 seconds & sip!<\/li><\/ul>",
            "show_icon": false,
            "icon_name": "icon-award",
            "icon_size": 40,
            "icon_color": ""
          }
        },
        "question_GGkzxG": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "default_open": false,
            "title": "How much caffeine is in a FlavCity Café Latte?",
            "content": "<p>Our Cinnamon Dolce Latte has about 62mg of caffeine per serving. Because coffee beans are a natural product, the exact amount can vary slightly from batch to batch.<\/p>",
            "show_icon": false,
            "icon_name": "icon-award",
            "icon_size": 20,
            "icon_color": ""
          }
        },
        "question_ApGtUK": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "default_open": false,
            "title": "Is there protein in a FlavCity Café Latte?",
            "content": "<p>FlavCity Café Lattes, Macchiatos, and Mochas contain 6–7 grams of protein per serving, all naturally sourced from 100% grass-fed whole milk. Our Café line wasn’t designed to be a <a href=\"\/collections\/coffee\" title=\"Coffee\">protein-packed latte<\/a>, but rather a better-for-you version of your favorite coffee shop classics.<\/p>",
            "show_icon": false,
            "icon_name": "icon-award",
            "icon_size": 20,
            "icon_color": ""
          }
        },
        "question_hrXKiH": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "default_open": false,
            "title": "Is there added sugar?",
            "content": "<p>The Brown Sugar Instant Latte and the Salted Caramel Instant Macchiato have 4-6g of organic coconut sugar. Coconut sugar is a natural sweetener from coconut palm sap. It’s minimally processed, contains trace nutrients, and has a lower glycemic index than refined sugar. We use it sparingly, only where other sweeteners couldn’t deliver the authentic flavor and balanced sweetness you expect with these flavors, while staying true to our no refined sugar promise. <br\/><br\/>The rest of the flavors have no sugar added.<\/p>",
            "show_icon": false,
            "icon_name": "icon-award",
            "icon_size": 20,
            "icon_color": ""
          }
        }
      },
